### SonarX DebrisGuard REST API Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension, Thunder Client, or cURL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Get Team Details (SDG Canvas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/team

### 3. Get Active Survey Missions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/missions

### 4. Get Seafloor Debris Detections
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/detections?mission_id=MSN-2026-BOB-09

### 5. Get Satellite Constellation & Radar Passes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/satellite/constellation

### 6. Compute Hydrodynamic Lagrangian Sinking Trajectory (Satellite Surface -> Seabed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/satellite/drift-model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "surface_lat": 17.6985,
  "surface_lng": 83.2120,
  "current_knots": 1.4,
  "heading_deg": 135.0,
  "depth_m": 42.0,
  "settling_velocity": 0.08
}

### 7. Uplink Debris Coordinates to Iridium LEO Satellite
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/satellite/uplink
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "DET-101",
  "satellite_id": "SAT-IRID142"
}

### 8. View Satellite Uplink Audit Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/satellite/uplinks

### 9. Operator Verification (Approve for Clean-Up)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/detections/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "DET-101",
  "action": "APPROVE",
  "notes": "Verified by maritime clean-up operator: high ghost net entanglement threat."
}

### 10. Operator Verification (Preserve as Artificial Habitat - Ecological Safeguard)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/detections/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "DET-105",
  "action": "PROTECT_HABITAT",
  "notes": "SDG 14.1 Review: Historic wreck formed thriving coral nursery. Do not disturb."
}

### 11. Run 6-Stage AI Sonar Pipeline Simulation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sonar/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mission_id": "MSN-2026-BOB-09",
  "slant_range_corrected": true,
  "tvg_applied": true,
  "speckle_filter": "lee"
}

### 12. Synthesize New Acoustic Target via GAN Diffusion (Stage 4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/synthetic/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mission_id": "MSN-2026-BOB-09"
}

### 13. Live AUV Jetson Orin Hardware Telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry

### 14. Real-Time SDG 14/12/9 Environmental Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sdg/metrics

### 15. Download Navigation GeoJSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export/geojson

### 16. Download Clean-Up Manifest CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export/csv
